{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98656","id":2152527844,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ATPfk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98656","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98656.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98656.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98656","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98656/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98656/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98656/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7ea594679e5f3112ea86a5d80833847bc4425df0","number":98656,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Shadow Light Energy Compatibility property to Light3D","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This multiplies light energy by the specified factor, but only when shadows are enabled **and** when using the Compatibility rendering method.\r\n\r\nThis can be decreased below 1.0 to compensate for lights having a different brightness due to sRGB blending being used for those lights.\r\n\r\nThis feature makes it easier to [adapt projects to the web platform when you also want them to run on native platforms](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1127), while still using Forward+/Mobile on native platforms. It also benefits projects that want to make full use of the automatic fallback to Compatibility.\r\n\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90259\r\nand https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10824.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n*Using a **Shadow Light Energy Compatibility** value of `0.3333` on all examples.*\r\n\r\n### Positional shadows\r\n\r\n*Lights at the top always have shadows disabled for comparison.*\r\n\r\nShadows disabled | Shadows enabled\r\n-|-\r\n![shadows_off](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f453a1e5-956e-4fc2-9df8-3e40a6253aa0) | ![shadows_on](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c987e808-984b-4f07-9c25-b3920cc88c8e)\r\n\r\n### Directional shadow\r\n\r\nShadows disabled | Shadows enabled\r\n-|-\r\n![directional_shadows_off](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cc6f167-f712-4ca5-a74a-2502247907cd) | ![directional_shadows_on](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1fd2bd9-415a-4817-9b84-21f8779e86ab)\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] Lower default value for the preview DirectionalLight3D that's used in the editor. Be conservative, but it should definitely be less than 0.5 (probably around 0.3). See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99174.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-10-29T21:49:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T07:54:58Z","closed_at":null,"merge